00:40:22.750 --> 00:40:24.190
in Google Cloud Platform.

00:40:24.190 --> 00:40:27.520
And the template we
leveraged that container

00:40:27.520 --> 00:40:31.330
to create and to be leveraged
to create an instance group that

00:40:31.330 --> 00:40:32.525
will be auto scaled.

00:40:32.525 --> 00:40:34.510
And in front of
that instance group

00:40:34.510 --> 00:40:36.370
