a load balancer,

00:40:36.370 --> 00:40:39.130
so we can actually
have one IP that is

00:40:39.130 --> 00:40:41.350
accessible by all the clients.

00:40:41.350 --> 00:40:43.870
So if we could switch
to the demo, please.

